+    /* Android receives a one-shot SAF descriptor rather than a reopenable
+     * path. Keep the successfully decoded frame and a sentinel filename so
+     * playback can reuse it after the descriptor is closed by the caller. */
+    /* Decode a replacement transactionally. A bad selection must not destroy
+     * the external frame that is currently active for this clip. */
